  "description": "Operating Area: Turkey\n\nM/S Dodo is a beautifully refitted 43-meter luxury gulet offering an elegant blue cruise experience along the stunning coasts of Turkey and the nearby Greek islands. Accommodating up to 12 guests in 6 spacious cabins, she combines modern comfort with refined interior design by Fatma Kısar. Equipped with premium amenities and supported by a professional 5-member crew, Dodo promises a relaxed, stylish and unforgettable charter with flexible cruising itineraries in the Eastern Mediterranean.",
